 buong araw.\nMonth 2:\n— -25kg na.\n— Belly flattened. Jawline back.\n— Fatty liver feeling slowly under control.\nMonth 3: SW:103kg ➝ CW:65kg\n— -8in waist\n— Bumuti ang mga sukatan ng katawan.\nNakatanggap lang ako ng dagdag na sweldo😂\nNagulat ang ilan sa mga lalaki sa garahe kung paano ako pumayat habang nakaupo lang, kaya ibinahagi ko ang aking sikreto!\nSana ay mag-udyok ito sa sinumang nahihirapang labanan ang pagiging sobra sa timbang. Maaari mong subukan ang paraang ito sa lalong madaling panahon; angkop ito para sa mga abalang tao na hindi makapag-ehersisyo: https://www.innerburn.store/health.com\nKung gusto mong bumili, bilisan mo, may 50% diskwento ang sale na ito! 😇💪"}, "cta_type": null, "display_format": "MULTI_IMAGES", "link_description": null, "link_url": null, "images": [{"image_crops": [], "original_image_url": "https://scontent-phl2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/905522858_1320827653461244_2074595662693502843_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=ub8K4pN_bt0Q7kNvwErbhVQ&_nc_oc=AdoU_lEAaExxmZNCt5oSmpJwWjHiNk6vKwK108qEjpHcJYIY06qurUAcsLv1rMlyk14&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.xx&_nc_gid=e_-6DEuwmDCoVg3mE9yoZw&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQQWUIn6piZyhUSpwzBHjMZVNms9jC8QcDiRSV-yjAvRJA&oe=6B05F428", "resized_image_url": "https://scontent-phl2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/907003835_4519294941651324_8797703868060356668_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=myQA2BrNzAwQ7kNvwGlWH7w&_nc_oc=Adrlrvuxan46wghtyjWmjQxT1HjdElpGDHXC3ZSGfzdiK8QSnWojzAbYe-Ak-LsGGf4&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.xx&_nc_gid=e_-6DEuwmDCoVg3mE9yoZw&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQTFxgc5wtcqP1-H42kS9GWabBEWuVWLpLQNEomePyEKcg&oe=6B05C6C7", "watermarked_resized_image_url": ""}, {"image_crops": [], "original_image_url": "https://scontent-phl2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/905916673_1187380820621922_4105034147147251059_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=GIGkSPUE_28Q7kNvwE